{
  "name": "LOPEST - Avisos Casa y Negocio a Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "30 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000001",
      "name": "Schedule - Diaria 7:30"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000002",
      "name": "Manual Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d0000a1",
              "name": "baseUrl",
              "value": "https://CONFIGURAR-DOMINIO-LOPEST",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d0000a2",
              "name": "telegramChatId",
              "value": "CONFIGURAR-CHAT-ID",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        100
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000003",
      "name": "Set - Config"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $json.baseUrl.replace(/\\/+$/, '') }}/api/cron/casa-negocio-avisos",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.4,
      "position": [
        480,
        100
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000004",
      "name": "HTTP - POST avisos del día",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 10000,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CONFIGURAR",
          "name": "Lopest Casa y Negocio Cron"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d0000b1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok === true && typeof $json.mensaje === 'string' && $json.mensaje.length > 0 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        720,
        100
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000005",
      "name": "IF - Hay avisos nuevos"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "={{ $('Set - Config').first().json.telegramChatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.mensaje }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000006",
      "name": "Telegram - Enviar avisos",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "CONFIGURAR",
          "name": "Telegram Bot Lopest"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LOPEST - Avisos Casa y Negocio a Telegram\n\n**Desactivado** hasta tener el bot y el chat. Una vez al día, 7:30 en Bogotá (después de *Salud diaria*).\n\n1. `Set - Config`: `baseUrl` = dominio público de Lopest; `telegramChatId` = chat de la familia.\n2. `POST /api/cron/casa-negocio-avisos` con la credencial n8n *Lopest Casa y Negocio Cron* (Header Auth: nombre `Authorization`, valor `Bearer <CASA_NEGOCIO_CRON_SECRET>`). El secreto nunca va en este JSON.\n3. El endpoint devuelve solo los avisos **nuevos** desde la corrida anterior (ya respeta qué reglas están encendidas en Configuración) y el texto listo en `mensaje`. Si `mensaje` es null: silencio.\n\nCada llamada **registra** lo que reporta: no la repitas a mano el mismo día esperando el mismo mensaje (saldrá vacío).\n\nErrores (401, 500, red): *Settings → Error workflow* = «LOPEST - Alertas de errores a Telegram».\n\nRunbook: docs/estado/lanzamiento-casa-negocio.md",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 600
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        240,
        -560
      ],
      "id": "5c7a2e10-8b3d-4c61-9e40-2a6f1d000007",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Schedule - Diaria 7:30": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
